FIGMA CONTENT RENDERING RULE:
When implementing Figma designs, ALWAYS render content exactly as it appears visually:

- Bulleted lists in Figma = HTML <ul> with bullet points (•), NOT joined text with \n
- Verify the VISUAL STRUCTURE matches Figma, not just the content text
- Test that lists, spacing, and formatting render exactly as designed
- Don't assume text joining is sufficient for list content
